        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She looks very careless.",
      "chapters": [
        217
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Four rank three juniors sit in that tent, two male and two female. Among the girls, Bai Cao Shuai sits opposite Bai Lian. The narration treats the pair as a stark contrast: she looks very careless and is ranked fourth that day, while Bai Lian has white skin and thick eyebrows with a fresh aura.",
      "chapters": [
        217
      ],
